ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003","quote":"世祖嗣位，徵為侍中，遷守左民尚書，未拜，為明威將軍、丹陽尹。天嘉三年，重授左民尚書，領步兵校尉，尋改前軍將軍。四年，侯安都徙鎮江州，以本官監南徐州。六年，出為仁威將軍、東陽太守。天康元年，以父憂去職。君理因自請往荊州迎喪柩，朝議以在位重臣，難令出境，乃遣長兄君嚴往焉。及還，將葬，詔贈巡侍中、領軍將軍，諡曰敬子。其年起君理為信威將軍、左衛將軍。又起為持節、都督東衡衡二州諸軍事、仁威將軍、東衡州刺史，領始興內史。又起為明威將軍、中書令。前後奪情者三，並不就。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003:m0129","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003:m0100","source_term":"長兄君嚴","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junyan-brother"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001","quote":"沈君理字仲倫，吳興人也。祖僧畟，梁左民尚書。父巡，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。荊州陷，蕭詧署金紫光祿大夫。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0023","source_term":"父巡","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"依本傳兄弟明文與君理父巡兩則原句暫接父系。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003:m0129"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003:m0129","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p003:m0129"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496"],"mention_coun